# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules for Samidha Reviews.
#
# Once samidhareviews.xyz's DNS is on Cloudflare and the apex is added as a
# custom domain on this Pages project (see the Wave 1 Section C PR body for
# exact console steps), this sends anyone who still has the old
# review-iq-demo.pages.dev URL bookmarked to the canonical domain instead of
# serving a duplicate copy of the same site at two hostnames (spec gate #2).
#
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects supports an absolute URL (with hostname) on the
# source side specifically for this pages.dev -> custom-domain case; a
# same-host rule would not apply here since pages.dev isn't a zone this
# account controls. Needs live verification once the domain mapping is done
# (rule 65a: unverified until then).
https://review-iq-demo.pages.dev/*  https://samidhareviews.xyz/:splat  301
